   "source": [
    "# Prepare model package\nmodel_package = {\n    'model': best_model,\n    'scaler': scaler,\n    'feature_names': X_scaled.columns.tolist(),\n    'target_name': target_col,\n    'cv_score': comparison_df.iloc[0]['CV R² Score'],\n    'model_name': best_model_name\n}\n\nwith open('best_model.pkl', 'wb') as f:\n    pickle.dump(model_package, f)\n\nprint('\\n=== MODEL SAVED ===')\nprint(f'File: best_model.pkl')\nprint(f'Model: {best_model_name}')\nprint(f'CV R² Score: {comparison_df.iloc[0][\"CV R² Score\"]:.6f}')\nprint(f'Features: {len(X_scaled.columns)}')\nprint(f'\\nReady for history matching.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 12. Engineering Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Model Selection**: The best performing model was trained using Bayesian hyperparameter optimization with GroupKFold cross-validation to ensure robust generalization across simulation runs.\n",
